  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產投資專論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPIC ON REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程擬以「不動產經營與管理」為教學特色，並為企業識別碩士專長的評斷依據。依此發展目標，將探討不動產投資的理論、原理與分析方法，並融入地產科技及不動產創業應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course intends to take \"real estate management\" as the teaching feature and provide the basis for the judgment of the master's degree. In accordance with this development goal, the theory, principles and analysis methods of real estate investment will be explored, and incorporated into proptech and entrepreneurship",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
